msgstr "python/"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "Triton core"
msgstr "Triton core"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"保留标准 Triton 的 Python 侧通用实现，包括 "
"`triton.language`、JIT、运行时、缓存、工具链入口等。与硬件无关的通用能力优先放在该目录。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the standard Triton Python-side general implementation, including "
"`triton.language`, JIT, runtime, caching, toolchain entry points, etc. "
"Hardware-independent general capabilities should be placed in this directory"
" first."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "`include/` 和 `lib/`"
msgstr "`include/` and `lib/`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid "保留标准 Triton 的通用 C++/MLIR 基础设施、Dialect、Pass 和转换逻辑。这里不承载 Ascend 专属后端实现。"
msgstr ""
"Retain the general C++/MLIR infrastructure, Dialects, Passes, and conversion"
" logic of standard Triton. Ascend-specific backend implementations are not "
"hosted here."

