"强相关的语言扩展、编译后端、运行时驱动、MLIR Pass、示例和测试。"
msgstr ""
"The root directory for the Ascend backend, centrally housing language "
"extensions, compilation backends, runtime drivers, MLIR passes, examples, "
"and tests that are strongly related to Ascend NPU, CANN, and BiSheng "
"Compiler."

