"Ascend 专属 MLIR Dialect、Pass 和转换实现，例如 "
"`TritonToLinalg`、`TritonToStructured`、`DynamicCVPipeline`、`AutoBlockify` 等。"
msgstr ""
"Ascend-specific MLIR Dialect, Pass, and conversion implementations, such as "
"`TritonToLinalg`, `TritonToStructured`, `DynamicCVPipeline`, `AutoBlockify`,"
