#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"Ascend NPU 相关 IR 与 BiSheng 编译链适配内容，是从 Triton-Ascend 编译流程继续下沉到硬件侧代码生成的重要组成部分。"
msgstr ""
"The Ascend NPU-related IR and BiSheng compilation chain adaptation content "
"is an important part of further descending from the Triton-Ascend "
"compilation flow to hardware-side code generation."

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
