msgstr "`tl.get_element(source, offset)`"

#: ../../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
msgid ""
"读取一个具有维度的张量，并返回指定偏移量处的单个元素。<br>**source**：源张量。<br>**offset**：元素提取位置的偏移量（整数元组）。"
msgstr ""
"Reads a tensor with dimensions and returns a single element at the specified"
" offset.<br>**source**: The source tensor.<br>**offset**: The offset "
"(integer tuple) indicating the position of the element to extract."

